<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NaPro started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NaPro started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analysts Craig Parker and Kim Dzien on Tuesday started coverage of NaPro BioTherapeutics Inc with a rating of long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We view NaPro as an opportunity to invest in a single product biotechnology company with a unique drug development plan,&quot; they wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- They set a 12-month price target for the stock of $14.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Boulder, Colo., company closed on Monday at 12.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
